Subject: Run the sample app on a supported Node.js base image

Why: the sample runs the newest Node.js release, ahead of upstream. Dependabot moved the end-of-life `node:18-slim` to `node:26-slim` (#829); upstream has since moved only to `node:22-slim`. Later bumps edit this patch.
Local-Issue: none (Dependabot bump #829)
Upstream-Issue: none filed yet
Retire-When: upstream's sample uses `node:26-slim` or newer

diff --git a/assets/Dockerfile b/assets/Dockerfile
--- a/assets/Dockerfile
+++ b/assets/Dockerfile
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 # Use official lightweight Node.js image
-FROM node:18-slim
+FROM node:26-slim
 
 # Set working directory
 WORKDIR /app
